{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/d5941579782a33c5e94943498b6c92ec.poster.avif?t=1763628425\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/d5941579782a33c5e94943498b6c92ec.webm?t=1763628425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/d5941579782a33c5e94943498b6c92ec.mp4?t=1763628425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can a toy car become the hero of a video game? One night, its owner vanished without a trace. Left alone in the quiet room, this little car sets out on a spooky and mysterious</strong>\u00a0<strong>journey - to find the boy...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player, you\u2019ll take control of the toy car, solving clever puzzles, navigating tricky challenges, and finding ways to escape the boy\u2019s home. But the journey doesn\u2019t stop there - the car ventures beyond the house into the foggy streets, abandoned places, and many other dark and atmospheric locations, all while chasing clues about the boy's mysterious disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/fbb43b14596ca5e3c1eae675ef0d5e2e.poster.avif?t=1763628425\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/fbb43b14596ca5e3c1eae675ef0d5e2e.webm?t=1763628425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/fbb43b14596ca5e3c1eae675ef0d5e2e.mp4?t=1763628425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The big world outside is full of dangers for a small toy car. Falling from great heights, fire, and water are just some of the perils you\u2019ll face. And there are enemies too - dogs, robotic vacuums, and creepy toy monsters that stand in your way. But don\u2019t worry! You can push, move, and interact with almost anything, thanks to the game\u2019s dynamic physics system, letting you find creative solutions to every obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/b3c473ea6d0183744cb43cc613a8a85d.poster.avif?t=1763628425\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/b3c473ea6d0183744cb43cc613a8a85d.webm?t=1763628425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/b3c473ea6d0183744cb43cc613a8a85d.mp4?t=1763628425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This thrilling adventure, packed with spooky yet heartwarming and emotional moments, is a game the whole family can enjoy. Uncover the haunting mystery of the boy\u2019s disappearance - maybe he needs your help more than you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your Wishlist today and don\u2019t miss the release!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3273260?t=1763628425","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763628425","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/ac7daee5ef02947cc31c19ca717037689b61becd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763628425","capsule_imagev